      "extract": "arXiv:math/0403224v1 [math.GT] 14 Mar 2004 DIFFERENCE EQUATION OF THE COLORED JONES POLYNOMIAL FOR TORUS KNOT KAZUHIRO HIKAMI A. We prove that the N-colored Jones polynomial for the torus knot Ts,t satisﬁes the second order diﬀerence equation, which reduces to the ﬁrst order diﬀerence equation for a case of T2,2m+1. We show that the A-polynomial of the torus knot can be derived from the diﬀerence equation.",
